WEBVTT

00:05:58.687 --> 00:06:03.442
KC: What's critical here, fundamentally,
what I have always believed

00:06:03.484 --> 00:06:07.071
and certainly have articulated
over the last 30 years,

00:06:07.113 --> 00:06:11.992
is companies exist
because society allows us to exist.

00:06:12.493 --> 00:06:15.704
And so we have
a responsibility to society.

00:06:16.372 --> 00:06:20.042
When we're developing
products and services,

00:06:20.042 --> 00:06:26.632
shouldn't we think about who is in,
who are we serving,

00:06:26.674 --> 00:06:29.343
and who might be negatively impacted

00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:31.804
by a product or service
that we're offering.